# ⚠️ Entity#collide is DELIBERATELY NOT widened. It is private in vanilla (Forge patches it to
# be overridable), and Fabric's AW spec makes a private method that is made `accessible` also
# FINAL, precisely to preserve invokespecial semantics — so widening it does not buy an override,
# it forbids one. The three mobs that override it (tiger, rocky roller, giant squid) are gated
# out on Fabric; restoring them needs a mixin on Entity#collide.
accessible	method	net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity	setLevel	(Lnet/minecraft/world/level/Level;)V
